      en: ["Ojojona was officially founded in 1579 by Spanish settlers.", "The town is situated at an average altitude of 1,340 meters above sea level.", "The local craftsmanship is based on a fusion of Spanish and Lenca traditions.", "There are two well-preserved colonial-era churches in the town center.", "The pottery industry uses local clays sourced from the surrounding mountains.", "The distance to the capital city of Tegucigalpa is approximately 34 kilometers."],
